  "solution": "The given equation is :**\n24 * 6 * 51 * 31 * 3\n\nWe consider each option and solve the equation by using BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/13bc0065c96e715682af7c8a6dc1b4c567b7a2a89597cc68809a5ff942c7e421.png] \n\nOption 1) =, −, ×, +\n\n24 = 6 - __**51 × 31**__ + 3\n\n24 = __**6**__ - 1581 __**+ 3**__\n\n24 = __9__**__** - 1581**__\n\n24 ≠ 1572\n\nOption 2) ×, −, =, × \n\n__**24 × 6**__ - 51 = __**31 × 3**__\n\n__**144 - 51 **__= 93\n\n93 = 93\n\nOption 3) −, ÷, =, +\n\n24 - __**6 ÷ 51**__ = 31 + 3\n\n24 - 0.117 = __**31 + 3**__\n\n__**24 - 0.117**__ = 34\n\n23.83 ≠ 34\n\nOption 4) +, −, =, × \n\n24 + 6 - 51 = __**31 × 3**__ \n\n__**24 + 6**__ - 51 = 93\n\n__**30 - 51**__ = 91\n\n21 ≠ 91\n\nHence **the correct answer is option 2)**",
